    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_job",
      "string_id": "3897210614595280370",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Somebody stole Heartbreaker Protocol. I built it to break emotional-conditioning loops. The Claws turned it into a weapon. Now they're selling it.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_job.wem",
      "duration_ms": 9120,
      "beat": "opening",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_3615AC67D9D55DF2",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_3615AC67D9D55DF2"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_hack",
      "string_id": "2827355708979248330",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Heartbreaker. That supposed to make me feel better?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_hack_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4480,
      "beat": "what",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_hack_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_273CC9098F617CCA",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_273CC9098F617CCA"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_hack",
      "string_id": "14981997704910797886",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "The original interrupts conditioning signals. Gives people a window to say no. Theirs keeps the signal screaming until the nervous system folds.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_hack.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8160,
      "beat": "what",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_CFEABF88DAECFC3E",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_CFEABF88DAECFC3E"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_recover",
      "string_id": "12750871977998759661",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Why not wipe their server?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_recover_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 1680,
      "beat": "recover",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_recover_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_B0F43281C91936ED",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_B0F43281C91936ED"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_recover",
      "string_id": "15538076547907395033",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Their build has the only live signing key. Burn it and I can't revoke the copies. Recover first. Patch second. Dramatic explosions a distant third.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_recover.wem",
      "duration_ms": 10320,
      "beat": "recover",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_D7A2564BCAD91DD9",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_D7A2564BCAD91DD9"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_name",
      "string_id": "13541029791074301620",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "You always flirt in your bug reports?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_name_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2400,
      "beat": "flirt",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_name_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_BBEB66D9FDF736B4",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_BBEB66D9FDF736B4"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_name",
      "string_id": "10364372180465013600",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Only the critical ones. Low-priority tickets get a tasteful wink.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_name.wem",
      "duration_ms": 5120,
      "beat": "flirt",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_8FD5A595D88ED360",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_8FD5A595D88ED360"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_accept",
      "string_id": "1619376887455519035",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "I'll get your code. Send me the route.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_accept_f.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3120,
      "beat": "accept",
      "male_audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_v_accept_m.wem",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_16792EB30643913B",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_16792EB30643913B"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_route",
      "string_id": "18019278892928713928",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Three Claws, two access points. Recover my code and its signing key from the first. Then use the second to shut down the stolen copies. Keep both boxes intact.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_route.wem",
      "duration_ms": 10960,
      "beat": "accept",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_FA1156AED1B5C4C8",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_FA1156AED1B5C4C8"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_velvet_bows",
      "string_id": "3543934580879065958",
      "speaker": "Velvet",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "And if you see little black bows in the interface, those are mine. Extremely important diagnostic equipment.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq004\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq004_01_velvet_bows.wem",
      "duration_ms": 6640,
      "beat": "accept",
      "female_lipsync_animation": "f_312E95B988850366",
      "male_lipsync_animation": "m_312E95B988850366"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq004_01_v_later",
      "string_id": "10858545669338369451",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Velvet",
      "text": "Got something else to finish. Keep the location.",
